specs:
- Target Files: gateway/conf.d/default.conf, gateway/templates/default.conf.template
- Route: location ~ ^/api/v1/challenge(s)?(/.*)?$
- Directives:
  * client_max_body_size 25M;
  * proxy_request_buffering off; (real-time stream upload without disk buffering)
  * proxy_read_timeout 120s;
  * proxy_send_timeout 120s;
  * Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Content-Disposition, Content-Length, ETag
